# "Your opponents can't cast spells from anywhere other than their hands" (CR 101.2, 601.3), a static ability of Drannith
# Magistrate, which Bot1 casts turn 1.
# - Turn 2: Bot2 casts from its hand freely - Faithless Looting, and Bonecrusher Giant's Adventure Stomp, which exiles the
#   Giant on an Adventure (CR 715.4).
# - Turn 3: Bot1, Drannith's controller and no opponent of itself, flashes back its own Faithless Looting.
# - Turn 4, with mana for each: Bot2 can't cast Bonecrusher Giant from exile (CR 715.5's permission is overruled) nor its
#   Looting by flashback. It Lightning Bolts the Magistrate and then casts the Giant from exile: the control.
# - Turn 6: Bot2 flashes back its Looting, the other control.

